:: OC Kade Intro 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 5>>
As you leave the locker room and begin to walk to the front of the school with the rest of the crowd of students, <span style="color:Yellow">you suddenly realize you’ve forgotten something in your locker!</span> You silently curse yourself and spin around to run back and find it, not wanting to run too late. The locker room is empty as you walk back inside, not even <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kohler</span> is present. You walk over to your locker and open it, finding what you were missing and quickly putting it in your bag. <span style="color:Yellow">But, as you turn to leave, you suddenly hear something coming from the gym. Sounds like someone is in there working out.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "OC Kade",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Gym",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hah!”</span> The voice says. You walk to the door and spy one of your classmates still in their gym clothes punching and kicking the air, preforming some sort of martial arts routine. You watch for a moment, pretty impressive with their speed and skill, but are left completely surprised as they turn towards you and you realize it’s <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kade</span>, that boy who got picked on in the hallway earlier! <br>
<br>
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kade</span> takes a deep breath, focusing, before snapping his fists forward so fast his shirt snaps, making a sound that echoes throughout the gym. He then takes another deep breath before doing the same thing with his foot, kicking high into the air.

<<if $OCKadeSocial > 0>>
    <span style="color:Yellow">If <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kade</span> is trained in martial arts, why did he let those kids pick on him earlier? Even with his small size, moves like these should have made short work of them!</span> You debate revealing yourself, but the sudden appearance of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kohler</span> stops you. <br>
    <br>
<<else>>
    <span style="color:Yellow">Was this why you suddenly felt so nervous earlier when <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kade</span> glared at you? Did your body know that he’s more dangerous than he lets on? With the look he gave you, you’re surprised he didn’t put you in a choke hold right there or at least try something like that.</span> You are wondering what you should do when the sudden appearance of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kohler</span> stops you. <br>
    <br>
<</if>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Got about 5 more minutes, alright?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kohler</span> says as he walks into the gym carrying some boxes. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kade</span> nods, thanking him for letting him practice here. The boy sounds nervous and unsure of himself, <span style="color:Yellow">the confidence he had while practicing melting away the instant <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kohler</span> walked in.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No worries, I don’t mind you getting some extra time in while I finish up some paper work- Hey!”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kohler</span>’s attention suddenly snaps to you, peeking out from the locker room. You jump at the sudden attention.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Mr. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.LastName</span>! Class has already been dismissed! What are you doing?”</span> <br>

