<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kade</span> spins towards you, realizing you were watching him as he turns bright red and quickly shrinks down. You try to fumble out an excuse, which isn’t really even a lie. You forgot something, came back, then walked over to investigate the noise you heard in the gym. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kohler</span> walks over with a raised, suspicious eyebrow before shoving one of the boxes he’s carrying into your hands. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Right. Well, since you’re here, you can help me carry this upstairs. Come on!”</span> You are shooed away as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kade</span> watches nervously. <span style="color:LightCoral">Seems you’ve been roped into some physical labor as punishment for spying.</span> <br>
<br>

<<linkreplace"Continue">>
    <span style="color:Yellow">The box is pretty heavy too, you have no idea how <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kohler</span> was able to carry a whole stack of them with little problem. You almost tumble down lugging it up the stairs and when you finally drop it on the table in the teacher’s room, you sigh in relief and instantly sink into a nearby chair, catching your breath.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
