            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You try that again and you lose the arm!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kade</span> says, <span style="color:LightCoral">though his voice sounds a little different. Lower, harsh, and blunt.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Leave <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kade</span> alone! Understand!?”</span> He asks, <span style="color:LightCoral">twisting your arm further until you yell out that you do. You hope that at this point the psycho will let you go, but instead you find yourself being marched painfully to the locker room door, completely overpowered by the small boy.</span> <br>
